    "title": "Rain wraps up through Thursday, staying cool - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ronelle Williams ,\n17 hours ago Scattered rainfall continues today. As of 5am most showers are to the north and southwest. However, there is more rain in Oklahoma that is heading in our direction. After rounds of heavy rainfall, some Flood Alerts will remain in effect today. A Flood Watch for a few counties will be in effect until 1pm but a couple of Flood Warnings for Sumner and Cowley Counties will be in effect through this evening. Read full article",
